{"words": [{"text": "سَلْ", "translation": "Ask"}, {"text": "بَنِىٓ", "translation": "(the) Children"}, {"text": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translation": "(of) Israel"}, {"text": "كَمْ", "translation": "how many"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم", "translation": "We gave them"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ءَايَةٍۭ", "translation": "(the) Sign(s)"}, {"text": "بَيِّنَةٍۢ ۗ", "translation": "clear"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "يُبَدِّلْ", "translation": "changes"}, {"text": "نِعْمَةَ", "translation": "Favor"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْهُ", "translation": "it (has) come to him "}, {"text": "فَإِنَّ", "translation": "then indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "شَدِيدُ", "translation": "(is) severe"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِقَابِ", "translation": "in [the] chastising"}], "sahih": "Ask the Children of Israel how many a sign of evidence We have given them. And whoever exchanges the favor of Allāh [for disbelief] after it has come to him - then indeed, Allāh is severe in penalty."}